   "mapID": 2521,
   "name": "Sirocca \"Swimmers\" Starfeather",
   "npc": "254149",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "<The $r before you sways unsteadily, clearly very inebriated.>\r\n\r\nI used to be a sailor, you know? Before the trouble started. The skycutters used to run between the islands. Now it's unsafe or some such, or so they say.\r\n\r\nI see the High Order and the Windshapers have their skycutters running again, but I'm stuck here, grounded!\r\n\r\nWhat aren't we being told!\r\n\r\n<He turns and yells loudly at the innkeeper.>\r\n\r\nWHAT AREN'T WE BEING TOLD, DONAAL!?",
   "time": 1791761335,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Zephras Isle"
  },
  "2993|f7a5deb4": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Druid",
